          display_name: "Left handguard bracket for rear foot brake setup",
          description: "This reference is required to install a handguard on a bike with a rear foot brake.\nSince the left handguard can’t be installed on the hand master cylinder, it will be mounted on this bracket.\nThe clamp SEX1-HB-HG-04 and 2 clamp bolts I14580-060016-08 are required.\nThe main top pivot bolt (STD-SC-0038) is the same if the left handguard is installed on the master cylinder or on the bracket but the bottom bolt is specific to the bracket-mount, part number STD-SC-0004.\nNone of these bolts are included with the bracket.",
