      articles: [
        {
          code: "super-grip-seat-jet-black",
          display_name: "Super Grip seat Jet Black",
          description: "The Stark VARG Super Grip seat is designed for maximum traction in aggressive off-road and motocross riding.\nIts asphalt-textured surface combined with four high-profile rubber ribs (6.1 mm high) keeps you firmly in position through hard acceleration, braking, and muddy conditions.\n\nInstead of traditional stitching, the seat uses ultrasonic welding to bond the materials without threads.\nThis prevents water absorption while delivering a clean finish, reduced weight, and long-lasting durability.\n\nCompatible with all VARG MX 1.0, MX 1.2, EX, and SM models. Available in black only.\n\nWhen the body kit is removed as a single unit, the seat comes off with it.\nThe seat attaches to the subframe using screw STD-SC-0007, located in the center of the rear fender.",
