      articles: [
        {
          code: "kyb-rear-shock-mx",
          display_name: "KYB Rear shock",
          description: "Factory-tuned KYB rear shock developed with Technical Touch for outstanding traction, comfort, and stability straight out of the box.\nThe 50 mm shock features a 16 mm NiCr-coated rod for low friction and durability, with triple adjustment for low-speed compression and rebound plus spring preload.\nIts optimized linkage progression delivers 303 mm of rear-wheel travel, balancing plush response over obstacles with controlled performance on bigger hits.\nFeaturing an internal setting optimized for motocross use, this shock is compatible with the VARG EX and VARG MX.\n\nFor faster riders, opt for one setting higher, while amateurs may prefer to go lower.",
