        {
          code: "shock-spring-50mm-36-n-mm",
          display_name: "Shock spring",
          description: "KYB rear shock spring for VARG MX and EX.\n36 N/mm\n\nChoose the spring rate that matches your weight and riding style for ideal suspension balance.\nStiffer springs (higher N/mm) suit heavier riders or aggressive riding; softer springs improve small-bump compliance for lighter riders.\nGenuine OEM-spec spring, drop-in replacement on the KYB rear shock.\n\nOriginal spring settings:\n\nVARG EX Soft: 46 N/mm\nVARG EX Medium: 48 N/mm\nVARG EX Hard: 50 N/mm\nVARG MX Soft: 54 N/mm\nVARG MX Medium: 56 N/mm\nVARG MX Hard:  58 N/mm",
