          display_name: "Front Tire Michelin Enduro Medium 2 90/90-21",
          description: "Michelin Enduro Medium 2 front tire 90/90-21 for the Stark VARG EX.\nA benchmark choice for enduro riders, combining excellent grip on hard and mixed terrain with the durability needed for long days in the saddle.\nThe Michelin Enduro Medium 2 profile is designed to deliver optimized performance across a wide range of terrain conditions. Its tread pattern features V-shaped blocks that increase the contact patch with the ground, improving traction, stability and control.\nIdeal for riders seeking reliable performance in varied enduro conditions.",
